{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n 12月になりましたね！\n \n 早く雪降らんかな〜☺︎\n クリスマスソングを聴くだけで\n 気分がるんるんします\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8HRY2XRY4MS37WQPRW8Z8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8HSYGJFYE9342641XP6EY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 私の部屋のベッドにある\n お気に入りクッション☺︎\n \n 肌触りのいいものがすきです！\n \n \n \n \n そして上海での初ライブ\n 皆さん温かくて本当に楽しかったです\n また海外でライブができるように頑張ります\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8HV039ZESEBSA56SX9F42","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 飲茶ランチをメンバー数人でしたときに\n ひなちまが撮ってくれたお気に入り写真！\n \n "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8HW0AGEYK2AC504SCY52Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF8HX2KQZPYVMR11MENQ6WP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"     楽しかった〜\n 謝謝☺︎☺︎\n \n \n \n ではまた！\n "}],"source":"archive"}